OL,3,GNEWSAWarning over canal basin where
OL,4,Amother drowned
OL,5,
OL,6,FA canal basin where a mother-of-five
OL,7,Fdrowned could pose a risk of further
OL,8,Fdeaths, a coroner has warned.
OL,10,FIn a Prevention of Future Deaths
OL,11,Freport, Joanne Lees, area coroner for
OL,12,FThe Black Country Jurisdiction, raised
OL,13,Fconcerns about lighting, signage,
OL,14,Fbarriers, rescue equipment and algae at
OL,15,Fthe canal basin off Wolverhampton
OL,16,FStreet in Walsall, West Midlands.
OL,18,FThe report followed the death of Jody
OL,19,FBrown, 38, who died after entering the
OL,20,Fwater in the early hours of 3 May.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
