OL,3,GNEWSAWarning over canal basin where
OL,4,Amother drowned
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn response to the coroner's report the
OL,7,FCanal and River Trust (C&RT), which
OL,8,Flooks after the waterways, and Walsall
OL,9,FCouncil said they had worked to reduce
OL,10,Frisks around the basin.
